      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WARREN'S LEDGER (3) was in the placings last time but shapes well for this on his excellent win the start prior, getting around this track over 350m in 19.57. Can return to winning form here if runs up to time two back. DR. LOUIS (7) has a strong record this track and trip with three wins and two placings from seven starts. Placed last time (24.80) at Sale in a Grade 5, finishing third and beaten 3.5 lengths. Looks well placed here and among the chances. WOODSIDE WOMBAT (6) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing fourth (25.07) in a Grade 5 at Sale. Has a good record at this journey. Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings three times from five attempts. Key runner on best form. DR. ZAIDEN (2) is a chance after winning last time.",
